Byte-strings review 2026-11-20 S1-1. scripts/bytes/run copies this directory to a workspace
whose path ends in `bytes_rc_é` and runs `query //:x`. `.bazelrc` imports a.bazelrc
(`--output=label_kind`) and then try-imports b.bazelrc (`--output=build`), both through
`%workspace%`: the output is the build form only when both resolve in the non-ASCII path; a
failing `import` is fatal, a failing `try-import` leaves label_kind.
